{
    "background_story": "In the mystical realm of Aethoria, Phoenix was a majestic being with the power to control the elements. According to ancient lore, Phoenix was the reincarnation of the great hero Rama, who had saved the world from darkness. As Rama's spirit, Phoenix possessed the same unwavering courage and unshakeable conviction. With wings as wide as the sun and feathers that shone like stars, Phoenix soared through the skies, bringing hope and light to a world threatened by shadows. As the chosen one, Phoenix wielded the mighty Rama's bow, firing arrows of pure energy to vanquish evil and restore balance to the land. With each victory, Phoenix's legend grew, and the people of Aethoria revered him as a symbol of Rama's enduring legacy.",
